# Clp at tier T0 — handicapped to JAOS's feature set.
#
# JAOS at T0 is: dual simplex, no presolve, no crash basis. -dualsimplex is
# the verb rather than an option, so it comes last: Clp reads its arguments
# in order and the solve happens where the verb is.
#
# One token per line, because the harness passes these unquoted and Clp takes
# its options as separate -name value pairs.

-primalTolerance
1e-7
-dualTolerance
1e-7
-presolve
off
-crash
off
-dualsimplex
